#problem(1)[
计算：


+ (1) $5(1)/(2) times (-(6)/(11))+0.25-(-2)^3 div(-2(2)/(3))^2$；
+ (2) $sqrt(14 times 24 times 39 times 91)+4 sqrt(27) times (-sqrt(3))$；
+ (3) $(-2(3)/(5))^0+4^(-2) times (2(1)/(4))^(-(1)/(2))-(0.01)^(0.5)$；
+ (4) $(2 lg 2 + lg 3 )/(2+ lg 0 .36+(2)/(3) lg 8 )$；
+ (5) $(tan (-120^ degree ) cos (-240^ degree ) cos 480 ""^ degree)/(tan (-60^ degree ) sin (-1050^ degree ))$.
]

#solution[
+ (1) 先把带分数和小数化为分数，并注意减去负数所得的符号，原式 $=(11)/(2) times (-(6)/(11))+(1)/(4)-(-8)/((-(8)/(3))^2)=-3+(1)/(4)+(9)/(8)=-(13)/(8)=-1(5)/(8)$.
+ (2) 将各因数分解并配对，得 $14=(2 times 7 )$、$24=(3 times 8 )$、$39=(3 times 13 )$、$91=(7 times 13 )$，所以
    $sqrt(14 times 24 times 39 times 91)=sqrt((2 times 7 )(3 times 8 )(3 times 13 )(7 times 13 ))=sqrt((4 times 3 times 7 times 13 )^2)=4 times 3 times 7 times 13 =1092$. 又 $4 sqrt(27) times (-sqrt(3))=4 times 3 sqrt(3) times (-sqrt(3))=-36$，故原式 $=1092-36=1056$.
+ (3) 因为 $-2(3)/(5) != 0$，所以 $(-2(3)/(5))^0=1$，且 $4^(-2)=(1)/(16)$，$(2(1)/(4))^(-(1)/(2))=((9)/(4))^(-(1)/(2))=(1)/(sqrt((9)/(4)))=(2)/(3)$，$(0.01)^(0.5)=sqrt(0.01)=(1)/(10)$. 因此原式 $=1+(1)/(16) times (2)/(3)-(1)/(10)=1+(1)/(24)-(1)/(10)=(113)/(120)$.
+ (4) 由 $0.36=(36)/(100)$ 及 $8=2^3$，得 $ lg 0 .36= lg 36 -2=2 lg 2 +2 lg 3 -2$，$(2)/(3) lg 8 =2 lg 2 $. 因而分母 $=2+(2 lg 2 +2 lg 3 -2)+2 lg 2 =2(2 lg 2 + lg 3 )$. 又 $2 lg 2 + lg 3 = lg (2^2 dot 3 )= lg 12 >0$，分子非零，故原式 $=(1)/(2)$.
+ (5) 利用诱导公式，$tan (-120^ degree )= tan 60 ""^ degree$，$cos (-240^ degree )=- cos 60 ""^ degree$，$cos 480 ""^ degree =- cos 60 ""^ degree$，$tan (-60^ degree )=- tan 60 ""^ degree$，$sin (-1050^ degree )= sin 30 ""^ degree$. 所以原式 $=(tan 60 ""^ degree cos ""^2 60^ degree)/(- tan 60 ""^ degree sin 30 ""^ degree)=-(cos ""^2 60^ degree)/(sin 30 ""^ degree)=-(((1)/(2))^2)/((1)/(2))=-(1)/(2)$.
]

